: 4) How do you get more holy water?

	One of the most frequently asked questions in this group: drop
 the flask(s) on an altar of your alignment and #pray. They'll softly
 glow amber (or was it light blue?) and there you are.

	Another way to acquire holy water is to dip a bunch of ordinary
 potions of water into a potion of holy water. You'll lose the holy
 water in order to get more. You may stack any items of the exact same
 properties on the same inventory letter with the #adjust command.

